#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where this account runs follows where its cache traffic comes from. A first placement is a guess, so it is corrected quickly on a clear majority; after that the primary moves only when another region has durably carried most of its runs. An account gains a region when that region's own traffic clears an absolute floor, and gives one up when it falls well below it. Pinning a service region takes the account out of placement's hands entirely."
msgstr "此账户的运行位置跟随其缓存流量的来源。初始放置是一种猜测，因此会在出现明确多数时迅速纠正；此后，只有当另一个区域持续承载其大部分运行时，主区域才会变更。当某区域自身的流量超过绝对下限时，账户将分配到该区域；当流量远低于下限时，则会取消分配。固定服务区域将使账户完全脱离自动放置机制。"

