msgid "Standing minutes are a monthly item on the account's subscription. Stripe bills them on every renewal invoice and the minutes are granted once that invoice is paid, which is what a recurring prepaid arrangement needs, since minutes expire with the cycle they were bought for. Setting them leaves the cycle now running exactly as it is. Zero stops the arrangement."
msgstr "固定分钟数是账户订阅中的一项月度项目。Stripe 会在每次续订账单中收取该费用，并在账单支付后授予相应分钟数，这是循环预付费安排所必需的，因为分钟数会随其购买的周期一起过期。设置固定分钟数不会改变当前正在运行的周期。输入零即可停止该安排。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:571
